      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-07-07T02:17:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is still a window of race here but I guess it\u0027s negligible.\n\nnit: chip_save_reset_flags(chip_read_reset_flags() | HELD_POR);\n\nmay discourage developers to add code in the window. Assembly is probably the same.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 91,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 94,
        "endChar": 32
      },
      "revId": "8e6aaac0de7b97c1de3080a54781ad6a23622deb",
